<h1>New passkey on your account</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>A passkey (<strong>{{passkey}}</strong>) was added to your <strong>{{appName}}</strong> account on <strong>{{when}}</strong>. It can now be used to sign in with a fingerprint, face or the device PIN.</p>
<p>If it was you, no action is needed.</p>
<p><strong>Don't recognize this?</strong> Remove the passkey on the security page, change your password and contact <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
{{> button url=securityUrl label="Review sign-in methods"}}
